1.	Any person who abuses his/her position or power to establish a fund against and causes damage to state property of from VND 50,000,000 to under VND 200,000,000 or previously incurred a civil penalty for the same offence shall be liable to a fine of from VND 50,000,000 to VND 100,000,000 or face a penalty of up to 03 years' community sentence.
