1.	Any person who deliberately discloses, appropriates, buys, sells, or destroys work secrets, except for the cases specified in Article 110, 337, and 342 hereof, shall face a penalty of up to 03 years' community sentence or 06 - 35 months' imprisonment.
2.	This offence committed in any of the following cases shall carry a penalty of 02 - 07 years' imprisonment:
a)	The offence is committed by an organized group;
b)	The offence has been committed more than once;
